  "summary": "作者说明武曲的将星作用体现为积极、坚持求财；阴性内敛，且会多吉星时仍讲究谋略方法，而非横冲直撞。首句缺前文，不据此独立判格。",
  "summary_en": "The author describes Wu Qu (Military Melody) as proactive and persistent in seeking wealth. Its yin, inward quality means that, when meeting many auspicious stars, it uses strategy rather than reckless pursuit. The opening fragment lacks its antecedent.",
